# Introduction to APIs

> **Module 1** of the **API Testing Handbook**
>
> Build a strong foundation by understanding what APIs are, how they work, why they exist, and why API Testing has become one of the most important skills in modern software development.

---

## Welcome

Welcome to the **Introduction to APIs** module.

Before learning how to test APIs using tools like **Postman**, **SoapUI**, or **Rest Assured**, it's essential to understand what an API is, how applications communicate with each other, and the role APIs play in modern software systems.

This module starts from the absolute basics and gradually progresses toward real-world API concepts used by companies such as Google, Amazon, Microsoft, Netflix, PayPal, Facebook, and thousands of other organizations.

Whether you are a beginner or an experienced QA engineer looking to strengthen your fundamentals, this module will provide a solid understanding of API architecture, communication, request-response models, and the terminology used throughout the software industry.

